        Recovery Section
       





         This is the Recovery Compartment. The snorkles will not be seen in the final model but I included them anyways. The spindly looking ‘legs’ will get cut away during assembly with the main structure. They are used as an assembly tool to help fit everything together in the right place. Again, this started out as an Engineering model so I have not finished much of the detail in this compartment. The basics are all there and the builder can detail it as much as they like.
        

         There is also a simple spreadsheet here to help organize all the parts.
        


